WEBVTT

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.550
Bye bye!!

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.710
S-Sorry!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.400
I'm really sorry!

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.200
But, listen, Mu-chi!

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.090
I was watching "Today's Fortune" on Ohayo TV.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.900
Oh, shortcut, shortcut.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.060
Umm, today's Aquarius is in the third position.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.980
and Mu-chi, your Scorpio was...

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:44.530
Your... Scorpio... was...

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.130
Just run already!

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.170
J-Just five minutes!

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.490
I think I just need five minutes.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.900
Okay? Okay?

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.620
Hey!

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.490
Nya?

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.490
Up here, up here.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.880
And a one, two...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.380
We're late, late, Mikan-chan!

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:17.590
Your call time

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:17.590
38 sec

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.960
Geez.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.800
To be late on such an important day...

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:26.500
No, a bit more that way.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.860
No, no!

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:29.800
I said to the left!

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.990
Uh, a bit more to the right!

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.380
Ah, maybe to the left.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.570
Which is it?!

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.040
I said, left!

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.850
Good morning.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:40.520
Mikan-senpai!

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:41.880
Good morning!

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.160
Good mor-

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:48.050
Uh oh...

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:51.210
Congrats on Graduating

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.840
Okay, okay!

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.510
I'll get out, I'll get out!

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.570
Please come with everybody after the ceremony, okay?

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:01.500
You must not peek at all, okay?!

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.680
Mikan-senpai!!!

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.300
Excuse me!

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:21.240
A.D. 2037

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:23.560
March 10th, 2037.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.990
March 10th

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:26.500
The 82nd Seioh
High School
Graduation

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.500
The 82nd Seioh High School Graduation Ceremony

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:28.710
The weather was wonderful,

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.340
a perfect day for graduation.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:37.390
Signed - Former Seioh High School Student Council Secretary, Inamori Mika.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.390
Finale

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.390
The Sakura-Colored Future

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.420
Manabi-chan!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.820
These sakura are wonderful.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.270
A full bloom!

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.280
Yeah.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:33.160
Nothing has changed at Seioh High School.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:37.490
Although we have been merged with Aikoh management-wise,

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.530
thanks to Kyoko-san's efforts,

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:44.540
the new uniforms and other changes to the school were cancelled.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:50.530
Rumor has it that Kyoko-san personally proposed this after the School Fair.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:53.440
Everyone's still easy-going.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:56.230
Some people read manga all day long,

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.800
others chat,

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.060
some eat snacks...

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:02.040
Nothing has changed at all.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.250
Was she there?

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.300
No.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.660
Gosh, where did she go?

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.820
Safe...

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.680
Uehara-senpai!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.080
YES?!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.240
HUH?!

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:25.900
You sure are popular, Mu-chi-san.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.570
Are you kidding me?

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.090
I don't swing that way.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:31.730
Oh, what's the big deal?

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.220
Why not give them a button as a present?

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.220
Note: When senpais give kouhais their (2nd) button, it means they are giving them their hearts.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.710
Momo, is that a new model?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.550
I told Dad that I'd be using it at school,

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.720
so I got him to buy it for me.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.620
Ah, I see.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:45.750
What was it called again?

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.820
Tokyo Digi... Digi...

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.310
Digital Journalist Professional School.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.030
And what will you do there?

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.870
Doing digital journalism, probably.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:57.660
Probably?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.950
You get into the Olympics and I'll be interviewing you, okay?

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:04.380
I just got into a professional squad.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.730
The Olympics are much too far away...

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.840
But you plan on going, right?

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:10.930
Well, some day.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.820
Well, good luck.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:16.360
Oh, that was an unexpectedly honest response from you.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.760
Quiet, you!

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.830
Mu-chi-san is headed for the pros,

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.130
Momo is going to a professional school,

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.640
Mei-tan's going to college!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.700
That's a pretty decent line.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:28.800
Yeah.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:32.380
But the most shocking one is still...

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.100
...her...

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:39.910
A free-ter?!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:42.410
Note: "Free-ter" is a term used for people who hop from part-time job to part-time job, showing that they do whatever they want.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.410
Yeah.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.170
Why?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.670
What do you mean, "Why"?

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:51.200
I just... didn't think it was like you...

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:56.120
You managed to graduate from high school, but you're going to turn into a free-ter now?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.410
It's not like this is old or anything;

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.240
I've never been a free-ter before.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.060
I've managed to experience the life of a student to its fullest now.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.480
So now, I want to work as hard as I can!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:13.740
To choose to work or to be a student...

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:19.070
That kind of worry was never a problem for Amamiya-san to begin with.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.400
Is that how it is?

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:27.110
Gree-tings!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:30.740
News Club

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.530
I brought some Christmas cakes.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:30.620
Want to have some?

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:35.400
These look... delicious...

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:38.760
These are Sol Plasticci a do mon cakes, right?

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:40.740
First-class quality brand cakes.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:42.100
Is that a special move name or something?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:45.360
Oh yeah, your family's pretty rich, right, Momo?

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.680
You didn't know?

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:52.150
The Odori Group is a big corporation that has more than sixty different enterprises under its wings,

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.260
Odori

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.260
Group Companies

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.260
Service

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.260
Real Estate/
Energy

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.260
Manufacturing

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.260
Investment/
Finance

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.620
She is the quintessential rich girl.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.760
I never knew!!!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.580
The makers of your air board,

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.460
our school's agenda books,

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:01.930
our cellphones...

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.000
...are all Odori Group companies.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.540
I never knew!!!

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:06.770
PLACEHOLDER

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.700
Wh-What else do you guys do?

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.700
And you, Mikan?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.420
PLACEHOLDER

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.420
Let's see, this computer,

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.340
What are you doing after you graduate?

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.650
these desks,

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:15.110
PLACEHOLDER

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:15.110
and the socks you're wearing.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.470
To America.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:17.660
I never knew!!!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.800
Notice things already.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.590
You guys are amazing.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.040
I've thought of going to America.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.570
You got yourself a cute photo.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.390
I had it retaken five times.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:41.070
Three years, eh?

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.620
I'll come back from time to time.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.530
America, huh?

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.280
So far away.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.360
Where in America again?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.490
LA?

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.990
Oregon.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.810
Oregon's the place that has the Angkor Wat, right?

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:57.070
I think that's Cambodia.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.820
You're not going to give up on studying abroad?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:06.460
You want to see what you can do in an unknown place.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.220
Yeah.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.340
You want to look for exciting and wonderful things by yourself all over again.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.050
Yeah.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.440
That's wonderful!

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:19.950
Mikan-chan, you're really wonderful!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:25.180
Seioh High School didn't change at all.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:29.450
However, I think I wanted to try and change myself a bit.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:34.110
The 82nd Seioh
High School

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:34.110
Graduation Diploma Conferral Ceremony

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:41.060
Look up and respect

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.470
my teacher's gratitude.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.600
And now the conferral of the graduation diplomas.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.950
Remarks from the graduating class' representative.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:10.320
They say "time flies by",

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:14.800
and the three years of student life really went by fast.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.880
As I stand here where our three years of high school life ends,

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.400
I say "time flies by"-

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.570
Uehara-senpai!

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:22.930
Please give me your button!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:23.510
Me, too!

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.780
I'll take your ribbon, then!

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:27.390
I want your skirt!

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.810
I can't give you my skirt!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.850
Bye Bye Seioh High School

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.990
New - Student Council Office

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.240
Congratulations on your graduation!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.320
Seioh

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.450
Graduation
Memorial
Party

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.240
To all members of the 82nd Student Council

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:57.320
Congratulations on your graduation!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.580
Seioh

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.420
Let's just start the party.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.050
Hey you, don't be eating!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.680
Here we go.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.600
Well then,

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:18.210
let's begin with the 82nd Seioh Student Council Reflection Meeting.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.650
Ahem.

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:23.360
Let's start with you, Mu-chi.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.690
M-Me?!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:29.390
Hey, I'm not even a real officer or anything.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.900
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:33.400
Neither are you, Odori-san.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.330
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.890
Umm... let's see...

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.150
That...

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.530
Next, Momo-chan.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.160
Hey!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.330
Yes!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.720
I don't have anything in particular to reflect on!

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.060
Let me predict:

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:53.880
You'll go through your whole life without reflecting on anything, probably!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.900
MerorinQ!

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.110
For me,

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:57.640
my first point.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.850
I would like to leave behind the know-hows of running the Student Council..

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:02.500
...to the next group of students not through my actions but data-

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.450
I'm next.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.540
Listen, damn it!

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:07.640
My reflection is about me causing trouble for everyone.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:08.570
I'm sorry.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.380
I'm always like "forward, go!"
and running ahead by myself,

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:15.000
and we got into a lot of trouble because of that, right?

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.770
That's all good, isn't it?

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.120
It was fun, after all.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.210
Yeah.

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:22.690
So even though I'll reflect on that,

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:24.080
I don't regret it at all.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.890
This ends the 82nd Seioh Student Council.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.640
But...

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:33.350
I'll be "Forward, going" in the future, too!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:41.140
And for last, I'll ask Mikan-chan, okay?

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.450
Do the finale nicely, okay?

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:46.140
Wow, I feel pressure.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.610
Umm...

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:54.440
My reflection is about me not taking action by myself.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:58.270
Although my tenure in the Student Council was the longest,

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.870
I always have to be dragged by everyone,

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:04.530
and I feel like I can only follow behind.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:07.840
So... So...

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.140
Huh?

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:18.920
Huh?

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.570
That's weird.

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:26.860
I wasn't going to... cry...

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.160
This is weird.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:39.410
I always... always have to be dragged by everyone,

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:42.400
and I feel like I can only follow behind.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.190
So, I want to go America,

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.410
Notice

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.410
Renovation planned, April 2037

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:49.370
so that I can find exciting and wonderful things on my own.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:51.670
But I don't wanna...

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.360
I don't want this to be the end!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.290
This to be the end...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.160
I want to stay at school longer!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:02.680
I want to stay with everyone longer!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.310
Mikan...

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.900
I...

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.820
Maybe I shouldn't go to America after-

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.200
Mikan-chan!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.090
Manabi-chan...

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.040
I want to be...

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.220
You need to go.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:38.410
You need to.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.670
We'll always be together no matter where we are or where we go.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.770
All of us, forever.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:53.980
Guys...

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.420
This isn't the end.

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:58.900
This isn't the end.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.410
This is a beginning.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:05.120
That's why you need to go.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:07.870
Okay?

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:25.770
"We will always be together."

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:28.010
It's easy to put it in words,

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.530
but I am scared after all.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:32.990
But, I'll try to believe in it.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.870
That we'll always be together.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:38.020
I'll be able to believe in that
if I remember all the things we did.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.670
So... wait for me...

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.660
Bye bye!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:49.830
I'll find a bunch of exciting and wonderful things when I get back!

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.290
JCT 1.5km

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.290
NEW AIRPORT ROAD

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.290
TRAFFIC JAM AHEAD

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:01.060
I told you we should've went by train!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.870
Quiet, you!!!

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.860
Fifteen minutes until boarding.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.520
We won't be able to make it!

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.320
It's all because Mei said we should go by car.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.400
You said it'd be easier this way, too!

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:16.900
Besides, why are you driving a manual car when you just got your driver's license?

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.370
It was cheaper, okay?!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:20.080
Ah, the engine stalled again.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.760
I'll be going, everyone.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.870
Mika-chin!

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:37.590
Inamori-san!

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:41.280
Mikan!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:46.910
Mikan-chan!!!

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:00.920
Guys...

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.950
Yes, this isn't the end.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.990
This is a beginning.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.450
Everything...

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.420
...from now on is...

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:40.270
...the beginning of our story starts now!

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:38.940
Banner: The 82nd Seioh Student Council members + alpha

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:41.420
1 year, 5 months later

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.430
Summer

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.520
You guys ready?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:39.410
Ready whenever!

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:41.920
Is this really okay?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:43.850
Of course, of course.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:45.870
They'll disappear after one night.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:48.480
Momo-chan's family invented this new spray!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:50.130
All right, let's go!

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.370
Forward...

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.800
GO!

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:56.830
Look, turn around now

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:01.170
but things like chances won't be there anymore.

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:05.630
That's what some people will tell you,

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:11.890
but there are just times when you can't move at all.

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:21.350
Yes, everything I say

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:25.820
is for your sake.

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.320
Sorry, but

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:30.610
I won't consent easily

00:22:30.860 --> 00:22:36.490
to things I don't accept.

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:43.500
Even if I can get by that moment with a lie

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:46.590
I'll end up regretting it afterwards.

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:49.380
Whether it's the past or the future

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:51.470
or, of course, the present,

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.890
I am the one that has to shoulder it.

00:22:56.140 --> 00:23:00.560
You'll understand the meaning to everything afterwards.

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:59.180
So let's worry!

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:04.810
even if you don't understand them now,

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:09.480
whether it has to do with pain, fortune or secrets.

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:13.860
So don't cry, let's hold each other as we go

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:17.370
forever-

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:23.120
It's My Life

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:23.120
because it's my life.

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:21.830
last frame of Manabi Straight! logo

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:28.880
The 82nd Seioh Student Council
